  "ingredients": [
    "8 large chocolate chip cookies",
    "3 tablespoons melted dark chocolate",
    "4 teaspoons melted white chocolate",
    "0.5 cup vanilla ice cream"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jeHNec6PJJNhkH332hF83ChSa_A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8285907-chocolate-i-scream-cookie-sandwiches-VAT-step-01-43705eb2b8d645bd8d5ac6d59a22d760.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8285907/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover the flat side of 4 cookies with melted dark chocolate; tap the cookies lightly to smooth out the chocolate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jQLJbba17sYyIVTLcaDZ7y8JR-M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8285907-chocolate-i-scream-cookie-sandwiches-VAT-step-02-a01ac378e0374daf84f4aaa9345dc88d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8285907/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While still wet, use a piping bag or spoon to make a ghost shape with the white chocolate; tap lightly once more to smooth as needed. More white designs can be added to the dark chocolate background if desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wCJFWLAsvuKtxlPPgcvmlpKmQ1g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8285907-chocolate-i-scream-cookie-sandwiches-VAT-step-03-4eefe3b16b984a459fe7c24fef7f08d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8285907/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use melted dark chocolate to make the eyes and screaming mouth; tap or shake once more to even and smooth out.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yZYpSuCT_jEOx6fcN-BuxzbgLEY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8285907-chocolate-i-scream-cookie-sandwiches-VAT-step-04-69601dd47ca94b0098d451380ad7c017.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8285907/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let chocolate cool until hard and dry to the touch, at least 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/taVgQm0CNoH4otjLUCBmtDnaQFA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8285907-chocolate-i-scream-cookie-sandwiches-VAT-step-05-543abbbe7cc743fba1db2a0b80a5aa65.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8285907/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Scoop ice cream on 4 remaining cookies, and cover with the tops. Carefully press to flatten, and transfer to a freezer to freeze thoroughly before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YNI-XPdBYBRLWyVZw6SlLCRZWhk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8285907-chocolate-i-scream-cookie-sandwiches-VAT-step-06-bff6c19156ad4235be5846b6dbb64a45.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8285907/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
